{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g3","type":"group","x":10,"y":900,"width":1870,"height":660,"label":"3. Protokol Uji Coba, Metrik Evaluasi, & Temuan Empiris (Gaur 2023, Sec. 8–9, hal. 32–44)"},
		{"id":"g1","type":"group","x":-360,"y":-280,"width":2380,"height":400,"label":"1. Persiapan Dataset & Preprocessing (DEAM -> 12D PCA -> KD-Tree)"},
		{"id":"g2","type":"group","x":-200,"y":340,"width":2080,"height":400,"label":"2. Pipeline Pembangkitan Playlist Baseline (TwoStagePlaylistGenerator — Gaur 2023, Sec. 7, hal. 27–31)"},
		{"id":"n11","type":"text","text":"### 10. Evaluasi Metrik Baseline\n`[Gaur 2023, Sec. 8.2.1–8.2.2, Eq. 6–7, hal. 33–35]`\n\n`src/metrics.py`\n- **Smoothness (PCC $\\rho$):** Cosine `0.9781`, Euclidean `0.9876`, Manhattan `0.9762`\n- **Evenness:** $\\text{Var}(\\text{RMSE})$ V-A & Audio 12D","x":880,"y":975,"width":340,"height":235,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n9","type":"text","text":"### 9A. Uji Single-Run (Q3 -> Q1)\n`[Gaur 2023, Sec. 8.1 & 9.1, hal. 32, 36–37]`\n\n`experiments/run_experiment.py`\n- $N=12, K=7$ (Cosine vs Euclidean vs Manhattan)\n- Output: `metrics_comparison_deam.csv` & `baseline_deam_traversal_plot.png`","x":40,"y":1240,"width":340,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n10","type":"text","text":"### 9B. Uji Batch 540 Playlist\n`[Gaur 2023, Sec. 9.1–9.4, hal. 36–44]`\n\n`experiments/run_quadrant_experiments.py`\n- 6 rute kuadran (Diagonal, Horizontal, Vertical)\n- $K \\in \\{5,7,15\\} \\times N \\in \\{5,12,19\\} \\times$ 2 metrik $\\times$ 5 trial = **540 evaluasi**","x":320,"y":950,"width":370,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n12","type":"text","text":"### 11. Temuan Kritis & Gap Riset\n`[Adaptasi Lokal — isi gap Sec. 10.2, hal. 50]`\n\n`analyze_intra_song_dynamics.py`\n- **98,11%** (1.768/1.802) lagu DEAM melintasi kuadran internal ($\\Delta = 0.1937$)\n- Baseline statis buta transisi *outro-intro*","x":1520,"y":975,"width":320,"height":235,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n1","type":"text","text":"### 1. Load Dataset DEAM\n`[Adaptasi Lokal]` *(Gaur pakai DMDD di Sec. 5, hal. 13–22)*\n\n`src/deam_loader.py`\n- **1.802 klip audio** (45 detik)\n- Anotasi statis $(\\bar{v}, \\bar{a})$ & dinamis 2 Hz\n- Normalisasi $[1, 9] \\to [-1, +1]$","x":-285,"y":-200,"width":330,"height":280,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n2","type":"text","text":"### 2. Preprocessing Fitur Audio\n`[Gaur 2023, Sec. 6.1–6.2, hal. 23–25]`\n\n`src/preprocessing.py` (`GaurPreprocessor`)\n- IQR Discretizer (`5.5 × IQR`, `bins=20`)\n- Yeo-Johnson PowerTransformer\n- **12D PCA** + MinMaxScaler $[-1, 1]$","x":350,"y":-200,"width":340,"height":280,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n4","type":"text","text":"### 4. Spatial Index (KD-Tree)\n`[Gaur 2023, Sec. 6.3, hal. 26]`\n\n`src/dataset.py` (`SongDatasetClass`)\n- Mengindeks koordinat unik $(V, A)$ 2D\n- Menyediakan query cepat tetangga terdekat untuk Stage 1","x":1620,"y":-200,"width":320,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n8","type":"text","text":"### 8. Iterasi Playlist\n`[Gaur 2023, Algorithm 1, hal. 27–28]`\n\n`src/playlist_generator.py`\n- Ulangi Stage 1 $\\to$ Stage 2 hingga panjang mencapai $N$ lagu\n- Hasil: urutan playlist baseline","x":1540,"y":390,"width":300,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n7","type":"text","text":"### 7. Stage 2: Audio Re-Ranking (CUDA)\n`[Gaur 2023, Sec. 7.2, hal. 30]`\n\n`src/stage2_selector.py`\n- Jarak fitur audio 12D PCA via PyTorch CUDA\n- Metrik: `cosine`, `euclidean`, `manhattan`\n- Pilih 1 lagu terdekat ke lagu terakhir $S_L$","x":975,"y":390,"width":350,"height":310,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n5","type":"text","text":"### 5. Input Seed & Target\n`[Gaur 2023, Sec. 7 & 8.1, hal. 27, 32]`\n\n- Pilih lagu awal $S_0$ (mis. Q3 Sad)\n- Pilih lagu tujuan $S_N$ (mis. Q1 Happy)\n- Tentukan panjang $N$ & kandidat $K$ (default $K=7$)","x":-160,"y":410,"width":330,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n6","type":"text","text":"### 6. Stage 1: Linear Waypoint + KNN\n`[Gaur 2023, Sec. 7.1, Eq. 5, hal. 29]`\n\n`src/stage1_knn.py`\n- Hitung waypoint target:\n  $$S_T = S_L + \\frac{S_N - S_L}{N - L}$$\n- Query KD-Tree ambil **$K$ kandidat** terdekat","x":400,"y":390,"width":350,"height":310,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n3","type":"text","text":"### 3. Stratified Split (Anti-Leakage)\n`[Adaptasi Lokal]` *(tidak ada di Gaur 2023)*\n\n`src/split_utils.py`\n- Train **70%** (1.261), Val **15%** (270), Test **15%** (271)\n- Transform Val/Test pakai parameter Train\n- Distribusi Q1–Q4 seimbang","x":1050,"y":-240,"width":340,"height":320,"color":"6"}
	],
